    "title": "Pittsburgh, Allegheny County opening cooling centers during high heat on Thursday, Friday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "With high heat back in the forecast on Thursday and Friday, Pittsburgh and Alelgheny County officials have decided to open cooling centers. Pittsburgh CitiParks is activating six Healthy Active Living Centers as Cooling Centers from 8 a.m. to 7 p.m. both days. The cooling center locations are as follows: Beechview Healthy Active Living Community Center Brighton Heights Healthy Active Living Community Center Greenfield Healthy Active Living Community Center Homewood Healthy Active Living Community Center Sheraden Healthy Active Living Community Center South Side Healthy Active Living Community Center Allegheny County officials, who declared a Code Red Heat Advisory, also highlighted a couple of other cooling centers opening on Thursday and Friday: Download the FREE WPXI News app for breaking news alerts. Follow Channel 11 News on Facebook and Twitter . | Watch WPXI NOW",
